Extend /config with signed-in identity, active revision, server health/probes, view/tool editing, redacted diff, impact preview, Apply progress/status and rollback. Use shared service and selected-user context from OAuth only. Retain safe secret values on redacted edit; sensitive entry write-only. Acceptance: phone-width, touch/keyboard/accessibility, stale edits, expired auth, validation/probe failures and operation retry flows verified; no restart needed for supported edits. Implementation/local evidence: docs/specs/remote-configuration-acceptance.md. Production and native-host verification remain separate release gates.
